{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL15MXLSlashContentV","text":"MXLSlashContent","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlashContent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlslash\/content"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlash\/content"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The slash group combines elements used for more complete specification of the slash and beat-repeat measure-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"style elements. They have the same values as the type and dot elements, and define what the beat is for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"display of repetition marks. If not present, the beat is based on the current time signature."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLSlashV7contentAA0C7ContentVSgvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL15MXLSlashContentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLSlashContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol","title":"content"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlash"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSlash/content":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlslash\/content","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/document